_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Help up <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a> characters, or remove Burning, Ensnared, Entangled, Enwebbed, Prone, and Sleeping. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion\" title=\"Scroll of Bestial Communion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion\" title=\"Scroll of Bestial Communion\">Scroll of Bestial Communion</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell can only be learned by a <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a> who <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribes</a> it from a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion\" title=\"Scroll of Bestial Communion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion\" title=\"Scroll of Bestial Communion\">Scroll of Bestial Communion</a>, which is obtained by reading <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caution_Before_the_Seelie\" title=\"Caution Before the Seelie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Book_Special_C_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Caution_Before_the_Seelie\" title=\"Caution Before the Seelie\">Caution Before the Seelie</a>, found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Sorcerous Vault</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;350&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1010</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040342\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.141 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 120594/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48049/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1629838/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n144.26%  177.804     71 Template:Trim\n100.00%  123.250      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  123.250      1 -total\n 30.08%   37.077      6 Template:Spell_action\n 18.95%   23.361     14 Template:Icon_text\n 15.06%   18.558      6 Template:Spell_action/format\n 11.04%   13.606      3 Template:Item_icon\n 10.06%   12.394      1 Template:Creature\n  9.62%   11.855      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  8.62%